# Node32-HUB — Third-Party Notices

This firmware statically links third-party libraries under open-source
licenses. Those libraries remain under their own licenses; the proprietary
notice in `LICENSE` applies only to first-party code.

Compliance materials (sources + relinkable objects for the LGPL libraries)
are generated on demand by `scripts/package_third_party.py` into the
`third-party/` folder of this repository and, when published, accompany the
corresponding GitHub release.

---

